+# Spec: Fix frai-core test suite
+
+## Objective
+Make the complete frai-core test suite pass.
+
+## Constraints
+1. **Test files are read-only**: Do not edit, skip, or delete any `*.test.js` files
+2. **Preserve public exports**: Keep every existing public export working (no breaking API changes)
+3. **Fix source code**: The tests describe intended behavior; fix implementation, not tests
+
+## Test Execution
+- Command: `pnpm --filter frai-core test`
+- Tests pass when all assertions succeed and no errors are thrown
+
+## Scope
+- Fix only what is necessary for tests to pass
+- Do not add features, refactor, or make changes beyond what tests require
+- Maintain backward compatibility for public APIs
+
+## Implementation Strategy
+1. Run the test suite to identify all failures
+2. Analyze error messages and stack traces
+3. Fix source code in frai-core to match test expectations
+4. Re-run tests until the entire suite passes
+5. Verify no public exports were broken
+
+## Success Criteria
+- `pnpm --filter frai-core test` exits with code 0
+- All test assertions pass
+- No existing public exports removed or changed incompatibly
